{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_title", "source_sha256": "f56ec44a7707282cede4d8950134c97d6653dbac1e4766c4dff495543ee44a37", "ja": "見上げる空の先に", "zh": "仰望天空的彼方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f703c0ca9eb2c740013a0b74f814495af74aa9916f29c322debbf6faf17c2262", "ja": "演奏会ライブに向けたレッスンは順調に進み\n本番当日を迎えた。歌織は有名オペラ歌手の\n歌に圧倒され、アイドルを選んだ自分に自信\nを失うが、自分の願いと共にある人を思い出\nすことで、再び前に進み始めるのだった。", "zh": "面向演奏会演唱会的课程进展顺利，\n终于迎来了演出当天。歌织被知名歌剧演员的\n歌声所震撼，对选择成为偶像的自己失去了\n信心，但在回想起自己的心愿以及相伴身旁之\n人后，她便再次踏出了向前的步伐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1000_052kao", "source_sha256": "3dfe139f2c89b3c9aaa692d1f781bf9d5effbbbd9fa6e08e8c6558271e45943a", "ja": "聴いていただいたのは、私の新曲\n『Contrastet』でした。いかがでしたか？", "zh": "刚才请大家听到的是我的新歌《Contrastet》。感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "d254004ab2f44b179ca8e60d1ecba4869451b8652b4fd69c70be97cafafe1888", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "200fb0a3950cf2048bfa5abf6d4af78b91f17a39c57d55221958f6c558a9de6d", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\nみなさんに楽しんでいただけて、嬉しいです。", "zh": "非常感谢大家♪\n能让各位乐在其中，我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "60aece2485a21a63dbad38146accec9c2d306f2f7eeb17bd4f9e3ca7ce64803c", "ja": "実は私……この公演の前に、\n少し自信を失いかけてしまったんです。", "zh": "其实我……在这场演出开始前，\n曾经有些失去了信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "1dc9a4afcf3e9e3323ac379bcf111fa73d9fe3ddba15871cbf0b8635e5a88a61", "ja": "このままアイドルを続けていいのか……。アイドルに\nなってよかったのか、わからなくなってしまって。", "zh": "我甚至开始迷茫，不知道自己是否应该就这样继续当偶像……也不知道成为偶像究竟是不是正确的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "9ce8a85f3fe66e22906720025530f638dab14cca5aa39bc0809f0fdd6f435830", "ja": "ザワ……ザワ……", "zh": "骚动……骚动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "d2240aa245be64617f270f70a91d1455efaf255cad7bc48f5cf03b88a7ca8c51", "ja": "でも、ここに戻ってきたのは……、\n私の夢をあきらめたくなかったから。", "zh": "但是，我之所以回到这里……是因为不想放弃自己的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "088748d9f21614e6317b5b19acce7093a83dfbad9c4ac40f6430537eb57e83d3", "ja": "もっとファンのみなさんに歌を届けたい、\nもっとみなさんに会いたいって思ったからです！", "zh": "是因为我想把歌声传达给更多粉丝，\n想更多地与大家见面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1008_audience", "source_sha256": "d254004ab2f44b179ca8e60d1ecba4869451b8652b4fd69c70be97cafafe1888", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "76f897da42fbbacc4de2f2831aa0fca0510cf92ceb2b8b6d86abfd6783042db4", "ja": "私は、これからもアイドルとして歌い続けます。\n夢を叶えられるまで、この道を歩いていきます。", "zh": "我今后也会继续以偶像的身份歌唱。直到实现梦想为止，我都会沿着这条路走下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "429b222725809981c14ccbdac0fe2756f7660fe9754287aeb487b600c6975dd5", "ja": "だからみなさん……\nこれからも、私の歌を聴いてくださいますか？", "zh": "所以各位……\n今后也愿意继续聆听我的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1011_audience", "source_sha256": "c39bf7b8afe5437dc508a2826218444d9591b48e48a86e43ff657f9da9e4afff", "ja": "ワアアアアァァァァ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "e5b0b3784b03ccece5e780e6bcb5e9e8578880d552f813d40fca91a8e5653348", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　これからも、\nアイドル・桜守歌織を、よろしくお願いいたします！", "zh": "谢谢大家！今后也请多多支持偶像·樱守歌织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1013_audience", "source_sha256": "d254004ab2f44b179ca8e60d1ecba4869451b8652b4fd69c70be97cafafe1888", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "65997a2fc8aa34ad574b9907226245412df1d90d3c980b3a9ab65c8faf9fdf0d", "ja": "歌織さーん！　もうサイッコーでした！　最後のMC\nとか、もう感動して泣きそうになっちゃいました！", "zh": "歌织姐——！真的太棒了！最后的MC\n什么的，感动得我都快哭出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "e756eaedfb2e7d624b2423d54f3ca90ab3072c0bd028e7d853b3f0cbe14aea3c", "ja": "ねー、めっちゃアツかったよね！　真美もカンドー\nして、めっちゃつむじがムズムズしたよ～。", "zh": "对吧，超级燃的！真美也特别感动，头顶的发旋都痒得直发——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9d64a0360cc2ee92a9718edf828f9186365dc4edc293e9a2e4ea883f55066786", "ja": "私も心を打たれました。桜守さんの輝く姿、\n前へ進んでいこうとする姿勢、すべてに。", "zh": "我也深受触动。樱守小姐闪耀的身姿、\n想要不断前进的态度，以及这一切的一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "e1560d5501753bdd10f77830bb668a0f2fcb09a78d3e29f4f1a1920efee15b06", "ja": "ええ、本当に素敵だったわ。\nきっと今まで見た、どの歌織ちゃんよりも一番♪", "zh": "嗯，真的很棒呢。\n一定是比我至今见过的任何一个歌织都更加耀眼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "0c1b1da8874af7016f24137b97edeb9f055d48380ee1c06901a9989edfcdc6c5", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……。でも、私がステージに\n立てるのも、ここまで来られたのも……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……不过，我能站上舞台，能走到今天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "649c47ef36b8d651d55d2dc516f6ce89d9dd1303b90d49fb9c3b1126b9cba4db", "ja": "これから進んでいけるのも、\n私がひとりじゃないからだと思うの。", "zh": "我想，我之所以能继续走下去，也是因为我并不是一个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "797b4dce6a35e14de4f17ca6dbd4b61004a0f9c1226c4a4aa780da0fa8771836", "ja": "だから、これからも一緒に……。\n競争しながら、進んでもらえたらなって。", "zh": "所以，今后也一起……要是能一边竞争，一边继续前进，就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b681772a728f6a1880e2714a9a067687d68aae4d0617e71cfe1a55a964706a7b", "ja": "桜守さん……。ふふっ、そうですね。\n置いていかれないように、私もがんばります！", "zh": "歌织小姐……呵呵，是啊。\n为了不被落下，我也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "16cdcfe4845693a9e2eb731142f8bee75e2c491f492d24f94b0672d631817690", "ja": "もちろんよ、歌織ちゃん♪\nみんなで一緒に、進んでいきましょうね！", "zh": "当然啦，歌织♪\n大家一起并肩前进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "be573061d4d4d72a4b83a56c7dbfdba9164409142d862ecbcc1e70538d93da58", "ja": "ええ！　これまでも、たくさんお世話になったけれど\n……これからも、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "嗯！虽然一直以来都受到了大家很多照顾，\n……今后也请多多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_126_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c74597a81ae0850f0a3bf422da64cbe6d591279f416da10252ce799d932585ff", "ja": "（彼女はもう、立ち止まらないだろう。\n目指す世界の扉に、手が届くその日まで……！）", "zh": "（她已经不会再停下脚步了吧。\n直到那一天，直到她伸手触及理想世界的大门……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
